    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "23FEA4E7BABD75E0",
      "text": "Give Mr. Saguaro some of your Sweet\\nHerba Mystica?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_system_02",
      "hash64": "23FEA7E7BABD7AF9",
      "text": "You don’t have any Sweet Herba Mystica...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_06",
      "hash64": "CDB47A6DB9FA27F9",
      "text": "So this...THIS is Sweet Herba Mystica![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_07",
      "hash64": "CDB4796DB9FA2646",
      "text": "I must—yes!—I must create something with it\\nright away![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_08",
      "hash64": "CDB4846DB9FA38F7",
      "text": "It’s so...very...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_09",
      "hash64": "CDB4836DB9FA3744",
      "text": "SWEET![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_10",
      "hash64": "CDB0F66DB9F711D6",
      "text": "My! What ambrosial sweetness! It is like a sweeter\\nHoney. A MUCH sweeter Honey.\\c\\nYes, as if Honey’s sweetness were multiplied\\nby one hundred![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_mob_01",
      "hash64": "5F8CA5AC90CF3D77",
      "text": "Hey, Mr. Saguaro! Whatcha eatin’?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_11",
      "hash64": "CDB0F76DB9F71389",
      "text": "Ah![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_mob_02",
      "hash64": "5F8CA6AC90CF3F2A",
      "text": "It smells suuuper sweet! And you looked so\\nhappy eating it!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_12",
      "hash64": "CDB0F46DB9F70E70",
      "text": "N-no! You see, ah...there is a reason for this![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_mob_03",
      "hash64": "5F8CA7AC90CF40DD",
      "text": "You don’t LOOK like someone who likes sweets,\\nbut that’s pretty cool!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_13",
      "hash64": "CDB0F56DB9F71023",
      "text": "Pretty...cool?![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_14",
      "hash64": "CDB0FA6DB9F718A2",
      "text": "I have spent my entire life trying to maintain the\\nimage that others have of me.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_home_d_15",
      "hash64": "CDB0FB6DB9F71A55",
      "text": "But now I see that it is possible to reconcile the\\ndifference between my outward appearance and\\r\\nmy inner love of sweets.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
